  "manual.assortedtech.chapter.extruder": "Extruder",
  "manual.assortedtech.chapter.extruder.extruder": "Right click it to fuel it, choose its direction and start/stop it. You can also punch it with an empty hand to start or stop it.\n\nIt will move in a straight line, mining whatever the material it is made out of can mine, and lays a block from its top slots behind itself at every step.",
  "manual.assortedtech.chapter.extruder.extruder.title": "Extruder",
